Statement of modification (GPL-3.0 section 5(a))
------------------------------------------------
  This is a modified version of Lafzi Android, ported to Flutter and
  modified in October 2026. It is not the original application, and the
  original authors are not responsible for the changes made here.

  Principal changes:
    - Rewritten from Java/Android to Dart/Flutter.
    - New targets: iOS, macOS and web (in addition to Android).
    - Search normalisation, trigram ranking and highlight logic
      reimplemented in Dart and validated against the Java reference
      implementation.
    - SQLite access rewritten to support sqflite and a WebAssembly
      build for the web target.
    - New UI (Material 3), settings, onboarding guide, share-as-image
      and voice search on iOS/macOS.
    - Application ID is com.xaepudin.lafzi, distinct from the original
      org.lafzi.lafzi, so both apps can be installed side by side.
    - Android application label is "Lafzi".

Bundled assets
--------------
  assets/databases/lafzi.sqlite
      Quran text, Indonesian translation and search indexes, taken from
      the upstream Lafzi Android application.

  assets/fonts/me_quran.ttf
      "Me Quran" font, taken from the upstream Lafzi Android application.
      This font is distributed under its own terms; see the font's own
      documentation before redistributing.

  assets/images/app_icon.png, assets/images/logo_lafzi_small.png
      Lafzi logo artwork, taken from the upstream Lafzi Android project.

  If you redistribute this application, verify that the database content
